Entry 5 — Reminder and Notification System
Design Issue
Students with missing work were not consistently followed up, leading to ongoing gaps in submission tracking.
Design Principles Applied
•	Hierarchy
•	Feedback
•	Repetition
UX Characteristics
•	Effectiveness
•	Usability
Design Change
I added a reminder system:
•	Automated notifications for missing work
•	Visual alert icon next to student names
•	Daily summary of outstanding submissions
Alerts are visually prioritised so they are not missed.
Impact on User Experience
This ensures Mr Marshall can consistently follow up on missing work, improving overall system effectiveness and reducing administrative workload.
